"coordinator, executor, dingo-store, and the cluster mode requires at "
"least three machines. The architecture view can refer [dingo-deploy-"
"architecture](https://dingodb.readthedocs.io/en/latest/deployment/deploy_on_cluster_by_ansible.html)."
