#: ../../source/deployment/cluster/deploy_in_single_node_using_docker.md:67
#: 2a555f23aa354900b2254e9bc5dd7698
msgid ""
"The docker-compose file includes 3 coordinators, 3 stores, 3 indexes, 1 "
"executor, and 1 proxy. You can modify the file to start only a subset of "
"these nodes or add more nodes based on your actual needs."
msgstr ""
"docker-compose 文件包括 3 个coordinators、3 个store、3 个index、1 个executor和 1 "
"个proxy。你可以修改文件，只启动这些节点中的一部分，或者根据实际需要添加更多节点。"

#: ../../source/deployment/cluster/deploy_in_single_node_using_docker.md:69
#: 86839a96726f4213b290db50cae56822
msgid ""
"The coordinators, stores, and indexes use the host network mode, while "
"the executor and proxy use the bridge network mode."
msgstr "coordinator、store和 index使用主机网络模式，而executor 和proxy 使用桥接网络模式。"

